description 3 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/3".

description 3 is a legal rule.

description 3 has the label "Article 3(2)(a)(i), Annex IV, point (3)".

description 3 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/531/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_531/FINAL/eng/anx_4/art_3/par_2".

description 3 has the digital dimension data.

