description 3 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 3 involves the process market surveillance verification monitoring.

description 3 produces item 3 action.

description 3 has the description "Where compliance of an EU fertilising product with the applicable requirements laid down in this Regulation has been demonstrated by that conformity assessment procedure, manufacturers shall draw up an EU declaration of conformity, in electronic form, and affix the CE marking.".


