description 9 has the description "Where a data carrier is used for providing access to the EU declaration of conformity, it shall meet the requirements for digital labels set out in Article 11b(4) and (5) and be based on one of the electronic technical solutions which economic operators can use for providing the digital label established in accordance with Article 42(9)".


